#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0507 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: A variable ending in DTF must have a label that ends with "Imputation Flag" (or "Imput. Flag") and contains "Date"
#note "Labels in the shapes of CDISC's own ADaMIG labels, on sponsor names: XDTF spells Imputation in full (as ADTF does), XHEDTF abbreviates to "Imput." (as PHEDTF), and XTHDTF / XRTEDTF interleave words between "Date" and the suffix (as DTHDTF / TRTEDTF) -> all accepted. The real ADaMIG names resolve to their own literal or template rows in the product and are never judged by a stem rule (PLAN-library-template-label-resolution T2 review L4), so the scenario uses sponsor names to stay on the stem leg."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *DTF name=*DTF label="{Date Imputation Flag}"
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *SDTF name=*SDTF label="{Start Date Imputation Flag}"
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *EDTF name=*EDTF label="{End Date Imputation Flag}"
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col XDTF type=Char label="Analysis Date Imputation Flag"
col XHEDTF type=Char label="Phase End Date Imput. Flag"
col XTHDTF type=Char label="Date of Death Imputation Flag"
col XRTEDTF type=Char label="Date of Last Exposure Imput. Flag"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | x | x | x | x
---
